1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,960
Hi, my name is Vinicius,

2
00:00:03,030 --> 00:00:05,880
I'm 19 years old and I'm from Brazil.

3
00:00:06,330 --> 00:00:11,640
English is not my first language, so I really hope you understand me

4
00:00:11,870 --> 00:00:16,760
and this is my CS50 final project.

5
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:19,200
OK.

6
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:22,700
My Shelf is a web app built with Flask,

7
00:00:22,760 --> 00:00:24,890
SQLite and Bootstrap.

8
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:29,170
It lets you track the books you want to read,

9
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:32,440
are reading, and have read.

10
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:36,010
I can create an account and log in.

11
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:40,440
My password is hashed,

12
00:00:40,870 --> 00:00:45,790
and every page after login is protected.

13
00:00:46,730 --> 00:00:50,120
I add a book with a name and a type,

14
00:00:51,040 --> 00:00:55,510
study or leisure. New books always start

15
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,540
on the "to read" shelf,

16
00:00:58,070 --> 00:00:58,820
alright?

17
00:01:00,170 --> 00:01:03,580
I can move a book between shelves,

18
00:01:03,550 --> 00:01:08,120
and the buttons only show the shelves the book isn't in.

19
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:16,970
In the details I save the start date, end date and notes.

20
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:21,220
If I reopen it, the data is still there.

21
00:01:22,210 --> 00:01:23,930
As a small extra,

22
00:01:24,250 --> 00:01:28,500
a book emoji follows the mouse inside this box.

23
00:01:28,650 --> 00:01:32,600
It starts on a click and stops with this button.

24
00:01:33,100 --> 00:01:38,680
Every query checks both the book ID and the user,

25
00:01:39,090 --> 00:01:43,360
so no user can touch another user's books.

26
00:01:44,340 --> 00:01:47,710
This is my project. Thanks for watching.

27
00:01:47,840 --> 00:01:50,360
I really hope you could understand me,

28
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:54,170
but if you didn't understand,

29
00:01:54,290 --> 00:01:59,060
I put a subtitle on the video and in the description,

30
00:01:59,140 --> 00:02:03,560
and I put my transcript in Portuguese and in English.

31
00:02:04,140 --> 00:02:09,190
That's it, thanks for watching, bye bye.

